        "original_id": "a07db5e2-778c-5df0-b115-0c369b709b75",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Lubabalo Nicholas Kondlo, Alex Moiseyev\n- Organizations: IMSA\n- Events: SportAccord World Mind Games\n- Places: Beijing, China; South Africa\n- Roles: Grandmaster of English draughts\n- Topics: English draughts, American checkers\n\nFacts:\n- IMSA inaugurated the SportAccord World Mind Games in December 2011 in Beijing, China.\n- Lubabalo Nicholas Kondlo was born on December 21, 1971.\n- Lubabalo Nicholas Kondlo is a South African grandmaster of English draughts, also known as American checkers.\n- In 2012, Lubabalo Nicholas Kondlo won the silver medal in American checkers at the SportAccord World Mind Games in Beijing, China.\n- In 2012, Alex Moiseyev won the gold medal in American checkers at the SportAccord World Mind Games in Beijing, China.",
